<translate>
==== UseWhileUnequipped ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If true, then this DrainableItem's charge will be spent when it is activated and not equipped.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
UseWhileUnequipped = false,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

